  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "This is Pip. Pip is a dog. Pip is a small dog. Lily is Pip's friend. Lily has a soft toy. The toy is brown. Pip feels the toy. Pip's paw is on the toy. It is soft. Yes, it is soft. This soft toy is nice. Pip likes soft. This fabric is soft. My paw is on soft. Lily has a hard block. The block is big.",
